<text><body><div type="page" n="172"><pb n="172" facs="#f0184"/>
<fw type="header" place="top">II.. Das Volk.</fw>
<ab type="heading" xml:id="p172-b1" facs="#f0184-b1"><lb n="1" facs="#f0184-l1"/>Uebersicht der Hauptkrankheiten in Procenten der Erkrankten:</ab>
<table xml:id="p172-b2" facs="#f0184-b2" rows="23" cols="5"><row role="label"><cell role="label"></cell><cell role="label"><placeName ref="#place-lobenstein">Lobenstein</placeName>.*)</cell><cell role="label"><placeName ref="#place-tanna">Tanna</placeName>.</cell><cell role="label"><placeName ref="#place-gera">Gera</placeName>.</cell><cell role="label"><placeName ref="#place-hohenleuben">Hohenleuben</placeName>.</cell></row><row><cell>Catarrhe:</cell><cell>9</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>5,00</cell><cell>7</cell></row><row><cell>a) der Luftwege</cell><cell>3</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>5</cell></row><row><cell>b) des Darmcanals</cell><cell>6</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>2</cell></row><row><cell>Rheumatische Fieber</cell><cell>1</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>1,17</cell><cell>4,74</cell></row><row><cell>Nervenfieber</cell><cell>1/2</cell><cell>0,36</cell><cell>0,2</cell><cell>0,80</cell></row><row><cell>Gastrische Fieber</cell><cell>4</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>3,82</cell><cell>4,26</cell></row><row><cell>Lungenentzündung</cell><cell>4</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell></row><row><cell>Lungenschwindsucht</cell><cell>2</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell></row><row><cell>Unterleibsentzündung</cell><cell>1/4</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell></row><row><cell>Kolik</cell><cell>1</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell></row><row><cell>Magenkrampf</cell><cell>2</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell></row><row><cell>Mandelbräune</cell><cell>1</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell></row><row><cell>Friesel</cell><cell>1/8</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell></row><row><cell>Blattern (Varicellen)</cell><cell>1/2</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>0,3</cell><cell>—</cell></row><row><cell>Bleichsucht</cell><cell>1</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell></row><row><cell>Krätze und ähnliche Hautkrankheiten</cell><cell>6</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>13,60</cell><cell>6,01</cell></row><row><cell>Flechten</cell><cell>2</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>0,2</cell><cell>1,03</cell></row><row><cell>Venerie</cell><cell>1/2</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>0,48</cell><cell>0,79</cell></row><row><cell>Masern</cell><cell>2</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell></row><row><cell>Scharlach</cell><cell>2</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell></row><row><cell>Kropf</cell><cell>1/2</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell></row><row><cell>Gebärmutterkrankheiten</cell><cell>3</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell><cell>—</cell></row></table>
<p xml:id="p172-b3">Auf <lb n="23" facs="#f0184-l23"/>die Geschlechter vertheilt kommen im <placeName ref="#place-bezirk-lobenstein-ebersdorf">lobensteiner Gebiete</placeName> auf 100 <lb n="24" facs="#f0184-l24"/>Kranke</p>
<list xml:id="p172-b4" facs="#f0184-b4"><item>1) Erwachsene <lb n="25" facs="#f0184-l25"/>68,50 Procent und zwar</item><item><lb n="26" facs="#f0184-l26"/>a) männliche 32,50 "</item><item><lb n="27" facs="#f0184-l27"/>b) weibliche 36,00 "</item><item><lb n="28" facs="#f0184-l28"/>2) Kinder 31,50 "</item></list>
<p xml:id="p172-b5"><lb n="29" facs="#f0184-l29"/>Die Mortalität beträgt durchschnittlich 3 1/2 Procent, davon 1 3/4 Respi<lb n="30" break="no" facs="#f0184-l30"/>rationskranke.</p>
<p xml:id="p172-b6"><lb n="31" facs="#f0184-l31"/>Für die Gesundheitsverhältnisse der männlichen Jugend enthalten die jähr<lb n="32" break="no" facs="#f0184-l32"/>lichen militärischen Untersuchungen einen sicheren Maßstab. Die Resultate dieser <lb n="33" facs="#f0184-l33"/>Untersuchungen für die Jahre 1864, 1865 und 1866 sind:</p>
<p><note place="foot" n="*)" xml:id="p172-fn1" facs="#f0184-fn1"><lb n="34" facs="#f0184-l34"/>Von Dr. <persName ref="#person-aschenbach">Aschenbach</persName> zu <placeName ref="#place-lobenstein">Lobenstein</placeName> nach einer 10jährigen Erfahrung.</note></p>
